Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `task.group` is a statement, not a value
  --> tests/ui/task_group_value.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |     value: task.group
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: A task group owns a block and its children until the closing brace
 Fix: Write `task.group name { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
